OL,3,AJive Bunny And The Mastermixers creator
OL,4,Adies at 84
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe man behind the novelty pop act Jive
OL,7,FBunny and The Mastermixers has died
OL,8,Faged 84, the company he founded has
OL,9,Fconfirmed.
OL,11,FJohn Pickles formed Jive Bunny in
OL,12,FRotherham in 1989 and the act went on
OL,13,Fto have three UK number ones with Swing
OL,14,FThe Mood, That's What I Like and Let's
OL,15,FParty.
OL,17,FJive Bunny records typically used
OL,18,Fsynthesisers and sampling to combine
OL,19,Fcontemporary pop music with hits from
OL,20,Fthe 1950s, 1960s and 1970s.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,180,160,200,105,0,100
