OL,3,AJive Bunny And The Mastermixers creator
OL,4,Adies at 84
OL,5,
OL,6,FA statement from the Mastermix company
OL,7,Fdescribed Pickles as "a true pioneer in
OL,8,Fthe music industry", adding that he was
OL,9,F"a leader, an entrepreneur, a
OL,10,Fbusinessman and an incredibly talented
OL,11,Fsongwriter".
